flowchart TB
  H[可信新事实写端] --> A[GitPublicationAuthority]
  B[原SessionPublicationBinding] --> A
  B --> V[GitPublicationVerifier]
  K[原独立Session Key生命周期] --> B
  A --> S[原冻结Scope与低敏Seal保护]
  A --> M[原HMAC实现与Git专属域]
  M --> C[新记录Seal候选]
  R[只读历史消费者] --> V
  C --> V
